<p>&nbsp;</p>', 'Until recently, Moyross Youth Academy (MYA) was one of Limerick’s under-the-radar success stories.', 'https://changingireland.ie/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/•-Four-people-from-Limerick-who-enjoy-MYAs-course-scaled.jpg', '', '[{"slug":"empowerment","title":"Empowerment"},{"slug":"income-employment","title":"Income & Employment"}]', '[{"slug":"department-of-justice","title":"Department of Justice"},{"slug":"moyross","title":"Moyross"},{"slug":"moyross-youth-academy","title":"Moyross Youth Academy"},{"slug":"wesley-joyce","title":"Wesley Joyce"},{"slug":"youthwork","title":"Youthwork"}]', '', 251108, 1, '2021-09-24T00:20:04Z', '2023-12-05T21:11:57Z', '2021-09-24T00:20:04Z')
