<blockquote><p><a href="https://changingireland.ie/e70m-in-leader-funds-for-2021-22-announced-today/">€70m in LEADER funds for 2021-&#8217;22 &#8211; announced today</a></p></blockquote>
<p><iframe sandbox="allow-scripts" security="restricted" title="“€70m in LEADER funds for 2021-’22 – announced today” — Changing Ireland" src="https://changingireland.ie/e70m-in-leader-funds-for-2021-22-announced-today/embed/#?secret=2332Ww4Ldq#?secret=2PgviCvBXU" width="600" height="338" frameborder="0" marginwidth="0" marginheight="0" scrolling="no"></iframe></p>
<blockquote><p><a href="https://changingireland.ie/leader-funding-1000th-project/">LEADER milestone: 1,000th project proposal approved for funding</a></p></blockquote>
<p><iframe sandbox="allow-scripts" security="restricted" title="“LEADER milestone: 1,000th project proposal approved for funding” — Changing Ireland" src="https://changingireland.ie/leader-funding-1000th-project/embed/#?secret=krzOng9eMu#?secret=dvZ4o3RAmW" width="600" height="338" frameborder="0" marginwidth="0" marginheight="0" scrolling="no"></iframe></p>', 'With a small LEADER grant – and some of their own hard-raised funds – a voluntary group brought hedgerow and biodiversity experts from near and far to meet and address locals about nature’s true value.', 'https://changingireland.ie/wp-content/uploads/2021/08/Hedgelaying.jpg', '', '[{"slug":"climate-justice","title":"Climate Justice"}]', '[{"slug":"community-development","title":"community development"},{"slug":"environment","title":"Environment"},{"slug":"fingal-leader-partnership","title":"Fingal LEADER Partnership"},{"slug":"irish-local-development-network-ildn","title":"Irish Local Development Network"},{"slug":"leader","title":"LEADER"},{"slug":"national-rural-network","title":"National Rural Network"},{"slug":"nature","title":"Nature"}]', '', 250959, 1, '2021-08-12T21:00:11Z', '2021-09-17T11:41:55Z', '2021-08-12T21:00:11Z')
